Warm up 200 m easy, resting as needed.
Drills, 4 × 25 m each with 20–30 s rest:
1) glide on your front: arms stretched forward, face in the water, breathe out slowly through your nose;
2) kick with a board: loose ankles, kick from the hip, not the knee;
3) side kick: lower arm stretched forward, 6 kicks, then turn your head to breathe;
4) front crawl breathing out in the water and in every third stroke (every second if that is too hard).
Main set: {main} easy, 30 s rest.
Finish with 100 m relaxed.
